# Starmod patch: remove boot logo / reduce console noise for faster, quieter boot

From: Starmod Developers <starmod@starillus.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] Starmod: disable boot logo and reduce default console loglevel

Remove the Linux boot logo (Tux) and lower the default console loglevel so
the Starmod kernel boots quietly and quickly on the Pillarium desktop.

--- a/init/main.c
+++ b/init/main.c
@@ -400,6 +400,9 @@
         printk(KERN_NOTICE "Linux version %s (%s@%s) (gcc version %s) "
                "#%s %s\n",
                linux_banner, ...
+        printk(KERN_INFO "Starmod %s\n", starmod_version);
+
--- a/drivers/video/console/fbcon.c
@@ -console logo section
-   fbcon_logo() removed

--- a/Kconfig
CONFIG_BOOTLOGO -> n
